Eric He and Tyler Katzenberger report: Personal information about millions of California students was stolen in a hack of a non-profit organization that contracts with the state’s Department of Education, officials announced Friday. The names, addresses, demographic information and disability status of all 7 million students enrolled in California public schools over the past three...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/10/17/hack-exposes-data-on-millions-of-california-students/">Source</a></p>

