NY&#8217;s Attorney General and CT&#8217;s Attorney General held both a provider and its IT company liable for a data breach. The settlement also includes a corrective action plan to improve data security.  New York Attorney General Letitia James and Connecticut Attorney General William Tong today secured $2.7 million from Boston Children’s Health Physicians (BCHP), a...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/10/17/ny-ag-james-and-ct-ag-tong-secure-2-7-million-from-boston-childrens-health-physicians-and-xtium-for-2024-data-breach/">Source</a></p>

