DysruptionHub reports: The health system disabled its network after suspicious activity, leaving MyChart and doctor searches unavailable and directing urgent medical needs to phone calls or walk-in clinics. A suspected cyber incident left Parkview Health patients without MyChart and online doctor searches Monday after the Indiana-based health system disabled its network in response to suspicious...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/10/20/suspected-cyber-incident-blocks-parkview-health-patient-portal-in-indiana-and-ohio/">Source</a></p>

