Connecticut Attorney General William Tong has been active in litigating data breaches. The press release below relates to a 2024 breach of Frontier Communications by RansomHub: Attorney General William Tong today announced a $625,000 settlement with Frontier Communications Parent Inc., resolving an investigation into an April 2024 data breach that compromised the sensitive personal information,...
<p><a href="https://databreaches.net/2026/10/20/attorney-general-tong-announces-625000-settlement-with-frontier-over-data-breach/">Source</a></p>

